@ ---------------------------------------------------------------- teksten (placeholders, Jordi herschrijft ze)
SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftPark:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out a park shaped like a POKé\l"
	.string "BALL, and a forest behind it that hums.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftLakes:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out three lakes, and three\l"
	.string "pairs of eyes that are definitely\l"
	.string "watching.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftChargestone:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out floating rocks and\l"
	.string "enough static to restyle your hair.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftGlimwood:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out glowing mushrooms and a\l"
	.string "forest that is far too pleased with\l"
	.string "itself.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftAreaZero:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out a crater that keeps going\l"
	.string "down long after it should have stopped.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftUnknown:
	.string "The rift shows... nothing. A silhouette\n"
	.string "of a green dinosaur. Then static.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Something in there\n"
	.string "is very, very round.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_RiftCoronet:
	.string "The rift flickers. Through it you can\n"
	.string "just make out a mountain at the top of\l"
	.string "the world, and something enormous\l"
	.string "breathing behind it.\p"
	.string "It isn't stable yet. Spacetime is still\n"
	.string "loading.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_Plaque:
	.string "SPACETIME CAVE\p"
	.string "Where places that no longer exist,\n"
	.string "never existed, or are in another\l"
	.string "cartridge go to wait.\p"
	.string "Please do not feed the timelines.$"

SpacetimeCave_Text_Researcher:
	.string "Ah, a visitor! I study the rifts. Mostly\n"
	.string "I study why they won't hold still.\p"
	.string "The one on the far left leads to a town\n"
	.string "that plays the same sad song on loop.\l"
	.string "The one below it smells like a very angry\l"
	.string "clone.\p"
	.string "The others? Unstable. Give them a few\n"
	.string "patches.$"
